        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-397: 3PL insurance adequacy — links to VS-26; CTL-42 (partner-bank-detail guard on settlements); operational: CFO sign-off
Owner: Logistics Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
