        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-397 (ensure controlled execution — 3PL Partner Onboarding &amp; Qualification (PA-56.1).) | - operational: partner-master status update; final-settlement bank-detail guard; operational: VP Supply Chain sign-off
Owner: Logistics Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
